==Trivia==
*His Japanese name, Giant Kurozō, comes from [[Le'noir]]'s Japanese name, Matsu Kurozō, itself derived from the words ''kuro'', meaning "black", and ''zō'', which can mean "to stock up on" or "to hide/conceal", both of which match Le'noir's description quite well; and when spelled with the kanji 象, ''zō'' also means "elephant". Matsu is just a surname.
*In the French translation of [[The Battle Cats]], Le'Grim is known by two separate names. In the [[Enemy Guide]] and event poster, he is known as '''Le'Grim''', just like in English. However, he is also known as '''Éléphunèbre''' in the French name of [[Le'Grim Strikes]] and his [[Meow Medals|Meow Medal]].
*He is one of the six enemies that were updated to have the Colossus type in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]], the others being [[Baron Seal]], [[Mega-Mooth]], [[Super Hyppoh]], [[Archangel Exiel]] and [[Big Peng Z]].

